#: kickpimwidget.cpp:486
msgid ""
"KickPim supports fast access to your <b>KDE Addressbook</b>\n"
"and reminds you about important <b>Events</b>\n"
"such as birthdays and anniversaries.\n"
"It also monitors multiple <b>Email Accounts</b>."
msgstr ""
"KickPim permite-lle ter aceso rápido ao seu <b>Libro de Enderezos de KDE</b>\n"
"e recorda-lle os seus <b>Acontecimentos</b> importantes,\n"
"como as datas de nacimento e aniversários.\n"
"Tamén vixia várias <b>Contas de Correo</b>."

#: kickpimwidget.cpp:522
msgid "&Thanks To"
msgstr "Agradecimen&tos a"

